<title>BELGIUM: EU suspends all molasses duties.</title>
<headline>EU suspends all molasses duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Wednesday suspended all molasses import tariffs, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The sugar management committee suspended all duties, including the small cane import duty set the previous week,&quot; the official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The committee set the cif reference price at 8.40 Ecus per 100 kg, up from last week's 8.20 ecus, and suspended duty at zero compared with 0.01 Ecus per 100 kg last week.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for beet molasses was set at 12.34 Ecus per 100 kg, compared with 11.96 Ecus last week, and duty continues suspended at zero. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
